        },
        {
          "id": "hd0t385cdp74",
          "status": "monitoring",
          "body": "We've identified the issue. Some customers may experience jobs that hang or fail to progress during Github fetch steps due to intermittent networking issues. Our engineers are actively monitoring.\n\nIn the meantime, we've seen success with increasing the no_output_timeout to 15 - 20 min to allow more time for Github fetches. This can be done by following this community guide: https://support.circleci.com/hc/en-us/articles/360007188574-Build-has-Hit-Timeout-Limit",
          "incident_id": "7cnl777wp9qz",
          "created_at": "2026-07-13T23:35:24.593Z",
